      "writtenOn": "2025-02-15T12:26:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem isn\u0027t specific to the same true/false block situation though. I can reproduce it when you have two separate `OpBranch` instructions that branch to same block, as you have the same problem of the same IDs being seen twice.",
      "parentUuid": "b607d7bd_a8039aae",
      "revId": "79c039d251871e99f359451291fed28c5792c9c2",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
